1},{"id":99593642367688,"type":"genre","name":"Grindcore","n":1},{"id":55893123468232,"type":"genre","name":"Experimental Rock","n":1},{"id":15318882910861,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Industrial","n":1},{"id":3321080584815,"type":"genre","name":"Avant-Prog","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":267285796937001,"name":"Jazz posmoderno: Murray, el World Saxophone Quartet, Zorn y Frisell","book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","start":1971,"end":2010,"desc":"Eclecticismo, desconstrucción, pastiche, parodia y performance: el jazz sigue el camino de las demás artes. Carla Bley mezcla free, fusión y clásica en Escalator Over the Hill; Steve Lacy reivindica a Monk; las sesiones Wildflowers retratan el Nueva York de los lofts; Air y Henry Threadgill van de Joplin a Ayler; John Carter narra la historia afroamericana en «Roots and Folklore»; Willem Breuker evoca a Weill y Brecht. David Murray, con ciento cincuenta discos antes de los cuarenta, quiere que la música «vuelva a tener swing»; el World Saxophone Quartet (Murray, Hemphill, Lake, Bluiett) toca sin sección rítmica de Ellington al free. John Zorn, warholiano, practica el zapping sonoro: game pieces (Cobra), Morricone, Naked City. Bill Frisell pinta paisajes en pastel. Joe Lovano tiende el puente con los tradicionalistas. El compromiso político se diluye y los clubes y sellos pasan a ser galerías que deciden las modas.","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Tradicionalistas y jazz contemporáneo","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#posmodernos"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":2667487209268,"artist":"Naked City","artist_id":268473258251017,"title":"Naked City","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"4CxHcJKU8iQ","kind":null,"book":{"id":6,"title":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/"},"scene":"Jazz posmoderno: Murray, el World Saxophone Quartet, Zorn y Frisell","scene_id":267285796937001,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#posmodernos","chapters":["Cap. 8: El free jazz y el jazz posmoderno"],"pages":[]}],"mentions":[{"book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","page":396,"text":"…—del mismo modo en que la ceremonia del té japonesa difiere de una funcional taza de café—. Una segunda serie de obras, que incluyen proyectos como Naked City y The Big Gundown (con música de Ennio Morricone), está guiada por la fascinación de Zorn por el cine, especialmente por géneros cinematográficos…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":2667487209268,"type":"album","name":"Naked City","list_id":118267099057662,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 1990s","src":"musthear","rank":428,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"7LLiZ_0-mLo","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":271813569514477,"list":"RYM Top — Jazz — Avant-Garde Jazz","src":"musthear","rank":108,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":256647743890097,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Avant-Prog","src":"musthear","rank":28,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":52260166018782,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Brutal Prog","src":"musthear","rank":3,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":22478217896300,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Experimental Rock","src":"musthear","rank":106,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":165490733860358,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Grindcore","src":"musthear","rank":20,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,"type":"album","name":"Torture Garden","list_id":79201857171461,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Hardcore [Punk]","src":"musthear","rank":162,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"yDlQj04GE8s","scaruffi":null},{"id":32020575322406,